  "summary": {
    "pt": [
      "A Rainha de Paus fala de calor, paixão e amor pela vida.",
      "Ela representa o fogo vivido com alegria e firmeza.",
      "O foco dela é: ousar viver o entusiasmo e confiar na força criativa."
    ],
    "en": [
      "The Queen of Wands speaks of warmth, passion and love of life.",
      "She stands for fire lived with joy and steadiness.",
      "Her focus: daring to live her enthusiasm and trusting her creative power."
    ]
  },
